%%     ONLY, and the enforcement is NOT in crew_config.resolve_config at all -
%%     it lives in crew_autocycle.settings() (crew_autocycle.py:137-178),
%%     which reads both raw layers itself and computes
%%     `machine.get("enabled") is True and repo.get("enabled") is not False`
%%     (:175) - a repo may turn auto-clear OFF (`enabled: false`) and never ON.
%%     onlyRepos/onlySessions are read from the machine layer ONLY (:177-178);
%%     a repo's own copy of either is never consulted, though it IS a
